  {
   "k": "T",
   "text": "Optimization log"
  },
  {
   "k": "T",
   "text": "The agent also kept a running log of the optimizations it tried in the same"
  },
  {
   "k": "T",
   "text": "README.md"
  },
  {
   "k": "T",
   "text": "file. The highest gains were observed from increasing/decreasing registers from the TMA/MMA warps and some deliberate departures the agent took compared to the C++ implementation:"
  },
  {
   "k": "T",
   "text": "- masking compares token indices, not tile column indices,"
  },
  {
   "k": "T",
   "text": "The optimization log table in the README file is:"
  },
  {
   "k": "T",
   "text": "change"
